WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.110
The first of March, 2018.

00:00:03.160 --> 00:00:05.450
Snow lies thick on a motorway.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.010
School gates are shut.

00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:12.070
A storm with a name of its own is on its way to join the Beast from the East.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:15.750
Ask people what they remember, and the answers don't agree.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:18.210
What did the cold actually do?

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:24.850
In this mission, you'll find out how cold it got and how deep the snow lay, and meet Storm Emma.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:32.310
You'll sort the impacts into social, economic and environmental, and see how one event can sit in all three at once.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:35.790
Your mission: find out what the cold actually did.
